                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive coverage of core subjects including Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Biology, and English.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-extrabold mb-4">💻</div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-slate-900">CBT Practice Engine</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Simulated computer-based tests with instant scoring, detailed solutions, and performance tracking.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-extrabold mb-4">🎯</div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-slate-900">Admission Guidance</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expert counselling on course selection, subject combinations, CAPS, and institution entry requirements.</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
